1. Why Playwright?
- It has built in features like autowait mechanism, reporter, parallel run, in-bulit test runner, also playwright support API testing just by using fixtures, debugging -retries, vedio trace , snapshot etc
- less falky tests naturally compared to Selenium due to the built in 
2. BDD 
Gherkin syntax for non technical users - easily understand 
Feature file has the test scenarios and in stepdefinitions we write the tests mapped to Feature
Given When Then which gives nontechnical users also visiblity on the scenario under test 
 -It cover the gaps in technical terms it will cover that
3. 3 Amigos
Business / Product Owner (BA/PO) – explains requirements and business rules
Developer – explains technical feasibility and implementation approach
Tester / QA – identifies risks, edge cases, and test scenarios
